WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:08.769
Speaker 1: in a scene completely beyond parody,
beyond satire and also a horrifying scene.

00:00:08.769 --> 00:00:10.230
I mean, it's both.

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:18.220
A group of white supremacists staged a bizarre
rally in Washington, D.C., over the weekend.

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:20.589
They wore masks as part of their outfits.

00:00:20.589 --> 00:00:23.430
Or maybe we maybe were supposed to call them
uniforms.

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:24.430
I don't know.

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:27.069
Outfits is a little bit emasculating.

00:00:27.069 --> 00:00:31.311
And thanks to some kind of issue with U-Haul
rental trucks, if you can believe it, some

00:00:31.311 --> 00:00:37.039
of them ended up being like stranded in Washington,
D.C. for hours, just based on poor planning.

00:00:37.039 --> 00:00:44.030
Now, of course, for me, the real story here
is once again, look at how this group of protesters

00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:48.109
Speaker 2: is treated by law
Speaker 1: enforcement and others compared

00:00:48.109 --> 00:00:51.199
to so many others at protests around the country.

00:00:51.199 --> 00:00:52.960
But we're going to get
Speaker 2: to that in a moment.

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:57.680
Speaker 1: The story is that about a hundred
members of what is now called the Patriot

00:00:57.680 --> 00:00:58.710
Front.

00:00:58.710 --> 00:01:02.769
If that name doesn't ring a bell, I'll explain
that as well in a moment.

00:01:02.769 --> 00:01:07.850
A hundred members of the Patriot Front Group
rallied in Washington, DC near the White House

00:01:07.850 --> 00:01:08.960
over the weekend.

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:15.270
Now, Patriot Front used to be known as Vanguard
America, but they changed their name.

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:16.820
Why did they change their name?

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:24.579
Well, because someone affiliated with Vanguard
America murdered a woman in that infamous

00:01:24.579 --> 00:01:28.700
Unite the Right rally in Charlottesville,
Virginia.

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:31.880
So Vanguard America was tainted.

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:34.600
Now they are Patriot Front, OK?

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:40.490
They were there chanting that they are trying
to reclaim America, according to our friend

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:43.399
Zack Patrizio from The Daily Beast.

00:01:43.399 --> 00:01:52.860
Their outfits or uniforms consisted of white
gators or masks, sunglasses, Blue Jackets,

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:57.009
khaki pants, brown boots, hats, shin guards
and masks.

00:01:57.009 --> 00:02:00.780
They also had American flags, plastic shields.

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:05.799
That looked really like toys, if you look
at the pictures and snare drums as well.

00:02:05.799 --> 00:02:07.020
Now how did police react?

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:09.650
Well, police shadowed the group.

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:16.060
Apparently, to prevent conflicts from starting,
and there are some who were upset that the

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:24.220
police seem to, in this case, be protecting
the protesters, whereas in left leaning protests,

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:30.040
they the claim is are more antagonistic to
the protesters and are instead protecting

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:31.040
counter-protesters.

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:35.340
Now, I think the reality is more complicated
than that.

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:39.510
And there is much more that could be said
about that.

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:45.890
But the funniest part was the completely abortive
climax to this thing where dozens of them

00:02:45.890 --> 00:02:46.970
got stranded there.

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:52.410
There were only 100 dozens ended up stranded
because they rented U-Haul trucks to get themselves

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:53.690
to the rally.

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:56.200
And one of the big trucks couldn't fit all
of them.

00:02:56.200 --> 00:03:00.310
So they waited for hours as the truck made
multiple trips.

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:04.400
I genuinely have been unable to find answers
to some basic questions about this rally.

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:05.480
Did they have a permit?

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:09.620
As many of you know, one of the it's sort
of like the

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:12.070
Speaker 2: equivalent of resisting arrest
Speaker 1: for rallies.

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:15.980
You know, we've talked before how when police
decide.

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:21.530
They want to make trouble for a particular
individual or a particular group.

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:28.940
This very vague charge of resisting arrest
enters the picture, and it's ripe for abuse

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:35.210
along the same lines when it comes to rallies
or protests whose subject matter some don't

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:37.320
like it becomes well.

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:39.850
Did they have a permit for the rally?

00:03:39.850 --> 00:03:43.010
I don't know the answer, whether they did
or did not.

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:44.010
Why were they allowed?

00:03:44.010 --> 00:03:48.630
Because remember, police were shadowing them
as they were stranded because of the U-Haul

00:03:48.630 --> 00:03:53.680
truck issue and the truck was going back and
forth stuffed with these guys.

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:59.010
Why were they allowed to bring masses of people
around in new halls which have no seatbelts

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:00.230
for each person in the back?

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:01.230
No padding?

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:03.710
It's against the law to do that as well.

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:10.860
Part of the story of why was this the treatment
that these individuals received, rather than

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:16.919
fill in the blanks with whatever example you
want from protests over the last year and

00:04:16.919 --> 00:04:22.780
a half sort of starting with, starting with
the George Floyd protests in the summer of

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:23.880
2020.

